with something like:
```php
$this->runStatement('
    USE ' . $this->getDB() . '
    MERGE (a:URL {url_hash: $fromURL})
    MERGE (b:URL {url_hash: $toURL})
    CREATE (a)-[rel:Link]->(b)',
