And using pattern comprehensions ( https://neo4j.com/docs/cypher-manual/current/syntax/lists/#cypher-pattern-comprehension ) :

Retrieving the group and its processes : 

```
MATCH (g:Group {id: 21})
RETURN {
processes: [(g)-[:DID_PROCESS]->(process) | process{.*}]
}

---

{
  "processes": [
