Extending with the same manner, for processes to include their subprocesses : 

```
MATCH (g:Group {id: 21})
RETURN {
processes: [(g)-[:DID_PROCESS]->(process) | 
	{
     node: process{.*}, 
     subprocesses: [(process)-[:SUB_PROCESS]->(sub) | sub{.*}]
    }
  ]
}


